{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Are we not counted as strangers to him.</b> Even at the time when the way of people is to give a dowry to their daughters — at the time of marriage — he treated us as strangers, for he sold you to him for the wages of labor." "<b>Our money.</b> Which he withheld — the money of the wages of your labor."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:25.378862441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}